OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to write off #95m SEND
OL,4,Aspending deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council will be able to write off 90%
OL,7,Fof its spending deficit for special
OL,8,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,9,F(SEND) after it agreed a plan with the
OL,10,Fgovernment.
OL,12,FSomerset Council and the Department for
OL,13,FEducation (DfE) agreed the plan, which
OL,14,Fincludes investment into SEND services
OL,15,Facross the county.
OL,17,FWithout the plan, the council would
OL,18,Fhave had to meet the cost of the
OL,19,Fdeficit in its annual budget from March
OL,20,F2028, which could force it to declare
OL,21,Feffective bankruptcy.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
