OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to write off #95m SEND
OL,4,Aspending deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Somerset Parent Carer Forum - a
OL,7,Fcommunity interest company - welcomed
OL,8,Fthe opportunity to "improve early
OL,9,Fsupport, strengthen inclusion in
OL,10,Fmainstream settings and create a more
OL,11,Fjoined-up SEND system".
